    </template>
    <template v-else-if="index === 11">
      <div class="closing"><div class="closing-logo"><Icon name="leaf" :size="38" /></div><div class="eyebrow">{{ slide.eyebrow }}</div><h1>让每一笔，<br>都更有<span class="green-word">意义</span>。</h1><p>{{ slide.description }}</p><div class="closing-actions"><button class="d-button d-primary" @click="emit('jump', 4)">回看 Android 架构 <Icon name="arrow" :size="16" /></button><button class="d-button" @click="emit('jump', 0)">返回封面</button></div><div class="closing-sign">RinklNote 记一笔 <span>记录生活，也读懂生活。</span></div></div>
