      <div v-if="index === 4" class="architecture"><div class="architecture-clients"><div><Icon name="phone" /><b>Compose UI</b><small>页面状态 · 交互反馈</small></div><div><Icon name="chart" /><b>ViewModel</b><small>StateFlow · 业务状态</small></div><div><Icon name="book" /><b>Repository + Room</b><small>本地账本 · 迁移链</small></div></div><div class="architecture-connector"><span>用户动作</span><span>状态流</span><span>本地优先</span></div><div class="architecture-server"><span><Icon name="sync" /> 同步边界 · Ktor API</span><div><b>身份鉴权</b><b>增量同步</b><b>冲突保护</b><b>QQ Bot 入账</b></div></div><div class="architecture-storage"><div><Icon name="shield" /><b>记录先落本地</b><span>断网可用 · 可重试</span></div><div><Icon name="chat" /><b>QQ Bot 辅助入口</b><span>同一账本 · 有确认回执</span></div></div></div>
