      <div v-if="index === 6" class="two-panels android-experience-panels"><div class="technical-panel"><div class="panel-label"><Icon name="phone" /> Android · 现场记录</div><h3>让手机成为最短入口</h3><p>Compose + Material 3 · 状态驱动界面</p><div class="android-shot-grid" aria-label="Android 真实界面预览"><figure class="android-shot"><div class="android-shot-status"><span>9:41</span><span>▰</span></div><img src="/defense/moon.jpg" alt="记账首页湖畔背景" /><div class="android-shot-card"><b>10月</b><span>支出 <strong>¥50.50</strong></span><span>收入 <em>¥0.00</em></span></div><figcaption>首页 · 按日账单与月汇总</figcaption></figure><figure class="android-shot"><div class="android-shot-status"><span>9:41</span><span>▰</span></div><img src="/defense/tree.jpg" alt="记账输入界面树木背景" /><div class="android-shot-card"><b>记一笔</b><span>金额优先</span><span>一步确认入账</span></div><figcaption>快捷键盘 · 一步确认落库</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li>底部导航保持记账、计划、资产、我的上下文</li><li>本地状态先更新，网络状态不打断输入</li></ul></div><div class="technical-panel dark-panel"><div class="panel-label"><Icon name="chat" /> QQ Bot · 创新延伸</div><h3>不打开 App，也能记一笔</h3><p>把“想起来却懒得打开”的阻力降到最低</p><div class="contract-row"><span>用户发送</span><b>午餐 20 元</b></div><div class="contract-row"><span>机器人解析</span><b>金额 · 分类 · 时间</b></div><div class="contract-row"><span>确认回执</span><b>已记入今日账单</b></div><div class="contract-row"><span>Android 回看</span><b>预算与长期管理</b></div><div class="panel-footnote">QQ Bot 负责入口，Android 负责完整体验。</div></div></div>
